": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Encrypted chunk upload with resume, download"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_syncengine", "label": "SyncEngine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subscribe before push, encrypt/persist/push, snapshots, awareness for open docs, at most 100 messages awaiting ack"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_lazy_documents", "label": "Live documents only for open notes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Closed documents stay in SQLite; their snapshots merge stored updates (CRDTUpdates.merge) without a document; close detaches before awaiting so a concurrent open gets a fresh instance; 10k notes: no growth on the iPad simulator vs +112 MB all live; Linux ~40 MB vs ~166 MB"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_incremental_indexing", "label": "Incremental parallel indexing (reindexChanged)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "contentVersion bumped by a trigger on stored updates; notes derived in parallel on all cores, batches of 500 in one transaction with cached statements; 10k notes: iPad simulator 6-15 s -> 3 s, Linux 4.4 -> 2.5 s"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_sync_once", "label": "SyncEngine.syncOnce (background refresh)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "BGAppRefreshTask: connect, catch up from lastSeq, send outbox, disconnect by a deadline; stores remote updates only"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_failed_sync", "label": "Failed messages (SyncStatus.failed)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Refused registration, server refusals, oversize or 5 failed attempts move messages out of pending into failed with a reason; retryFailed/discardFailed; deleteDocument drops the queue; rest keeps syncing; SyncStatus.summary offline/syncing/synced/failed; temporary failures retried with backoff 1 s to 1 min"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_agent_created_notes", "label": "NoteMeta.createdByAgent (D-45)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "AgentAuthor {agentId, agentName, at} or nil, tolerant read; clearCreatedByAgent for the \u00ab\u041f\u043e\u043d\u044f\u0442\u043d\u043e\u00bb strip"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_notebook_meta_copy", "label": "Notebook meta copy for agents", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "name, icon, color token, space in notebook meta; setMetaCopy, AccountService.refreshNotebookMeta"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_flaky_network", "label": "Resilience to stuck TLS handshakes", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One URLSession (DSNetwork), short attempt timeouts and jittered retries: any request when certainly not sent, idempotent ones also after timeouts/502-504; token refresh retried within the server 60 s grace window; WebSocket handshake timeout with quick reconnects; status stays syncing"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_canonical_notebook_keys", "label": "Canonical notebook key from the server", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "reconcileNotebookKeys on every start; differing local key retired (read-only); notebookKeyForWriting fetches instead of creating; rewrapNoteKeys; SyncEngine.rekey re-fetches and uploads a canonical snapshot"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_quarantine", "label": "Quarantine of unreadable remote items", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Undecryptable or invalid updates are set aside (seq, device, reason), the rest applied, lastSeq advances; SyncStatus.unreadable per notebook; retryUnreadable after key repair; a device with a server-confirmed key uploads a covering snapshot"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_logout_keeps_unsent", "label": "Sign-out keeps keys of unsent notebooks (spec/07)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "KeyRing.clear(keepingNotebooks:owner:), resolveKeptKeys on sign-in (same account keeps, another removes), eraseDeviceKeys, unsentChangeCount"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_wait_for_key", "label": "No key yet is not unreadable", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A document without a key waits: not subscribed or unsubscribed, nothing skipped, lastSeq kept; resumes after a notebook index update or resumeDocumentsWaitingForKeys (moved-note race); its outgoing messages count as SyncStatus.held, not pending"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_sync_speed", "label": "Sync speed: lazy registration, priority subscribe, focus", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Subscribe without waiting for POST /docs (register before push or on doc_not_found for unregistered records, deleted docs not resurrected); account, indexes and focused notes in the first frame, rest in batches of 100; SyncTraceEvent via setTraceHandler; SyncPerfTests: 51 notes x 25 KB at RTT 100 ms ~1.2 s (CI limit 10 s), 55 known docs ~0.9 s (limit 5 s)"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_syncclient", "label": "SyncClient (WebSocket)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "hello/welcome, pings, backoff reconnect"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_apiclient", "label": "APIClient (REST)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "api.md endpoints, token refresh"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_test_vectors", "label": "Shared test vectors (VectorTests)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "apps/ios/Packages/DSCore/README.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "packages/test-vectors checked in Swift"}, {"id": "apps_ios_packages_dscore_readme_benchmarks", "label": "spec/11 benchmarks (BenchmarkTests)", "file_type": "c